      "modelName": "conradlocke/krea2-identity-edit",
      "modelDescription": "Krea2-identity-edit是一款专注于图像编辑的专业工具，旨在实现精准的身份保留与局部修改。版本v1.1改进了人脸相似度与编辑区域约束，在保持构图稳定性方面表现出色，特别适用于双人图像处理及精细的对象替换任务。开发者推荐在1-1.5MP分辨率下使用，并提供不同秩的量化版本以适配低显存需求。",
      "sourceDescription": "v1.1 (recommended): krea2 identity edit v1 1.safetensors — substantially improved face likeness and image fidelity, much stronger edit locality (camera, pose, and untouched elements stay fixed far more reliably), better two-person identity separation, more reliable object remove/replace, better compound outfit-change compliance, corrected reference geometry handling. One honest regression: person -replacement (\"replace the woman with an orangutan\") is currently weaker than v1 — keep v1 for that use case until v1.2. No high-resolution adaptation pass yet: at high resolutions (especially two-person edits) identities can bleed together — prefer 1–1.5MP and upscale. v1 remains available for workflow reproducibility. Low-VRAM variants: ... v1 1 r128.safetensors (0.91GB) and ... v1 1 r64.safetensors (0.46GB) — SVD rank-reduced from v1.1, near-identical quality.",
